KEYSTROKES:
# Whole-year print for 2026 (per the User Instructions above: press A to
# initialize; key start year, R/S; key start month, R/S; press C for balance
# of year — starting at month 1 (January) prints the whole year). Steps 1-2
# (init, keying year/month) are left at regular speed and outside the
# elapsed-time measurement; only the print itself (triggered by C) is timed,
# and run at full speed.
